=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# Use Google DNS ###############################################$
$
# DNS Configuration --------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Nameservers          8.8.8.8, 8.8.4.4$
   -  Search Domains       example.net$
   -  dhcpcd may rewrite /etc/resolv.conf on a lease$
   -  Saving hardn.yml loses its comments$
$
   -  Set the nameservers$
      /etc/resolv.conf$
      @@ -1,3 +1,4 @@$
       # Generated by dhcpcd from eth0.dhcp$
       search example.net$
      -nameserver 192.0.2.1$
      +nameserver 8.8.8.8$
      +nameserver 8.8.4.4$
$
   -  Save the configuration$
      /etc/hardn/hardn.yml$
$
  Use Google DNS? [y/N, 0 or q]: y$

